# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Shinnosuke Hattori et al. (2026). Chemical intuition on bond-dissociation energies as an emergent ability of universal machine-learning interatomic potentials.
#   Nature Communications. doi:10.1038/s41467-026-74919-8
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 ec3af71b43647796...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 309 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
