# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/hattori2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: Allegro models trained on cohesive energies with an
# edge-energy decomposition, on SPICE2, the MatPES r2SCAN subset or their
# hybrid, with tensor sizes 64 and 128, and their MAEs of activation and
# reaction energies on Transition1x (Table 1). Learned bond energies,
# internal-representation entropies and scaling curves are analyses, not
# error metrics.

